Fast-Planner integration notice
===============================

Upstream project: https://github.com/HKUST-Aerial-Robotics/Fast-Planner
Imported revision: 4c1703acfa22bffccb240bb9c738344e62585df4
Import date: 2026-07-27

This directory contains the Fast-Planner planning-core packages needed by
UAV-Autonomy-All-in-One. The upstream simulator, waypoint generator and
controller packages are intentionally not imported.

Local modifications:

* add a ROS multi-planner adapter and isolate the Fast-Planner workspace;
* accept the framework's world-frame point cloud and odometry contract;
* preserve requested goal altitude and support execution-time preemption;
* validate FSM inputs and fail closed at map boundaries;
* make the fixed SDF map origin configurable and bound map allocation;
* reject unsupported dynamic-obstacle mode;
* discover NLopt through CMake/pkg-config rather than fixed /usr/local paths.

The upstream LICENSE and file-level copyright/license notices are retained.
The repository is distributed conservatively under GPL-3.0; some upstream
source files additionally state LGPL-3.0-or-later.
